  <div id="sutta">
  
            <h4 id="thag1.109" class="h1">Thag 1:109  Saṅgharakkhita</h4>
            <div class="verse">
              <p>Why,</p>
              <p>having gone into solitude,</p>
              <p>does he not take account</p>
              <p>of the message</p>
              <p>of the one sympathetic</p>
              <p>to his foremost well-being?</p>
              <p class="v2">Because he dwells</p>
              <p class="v2">with his faculties</p>
              <p class="v6">exposed,</p>
              <p class="v2">like a tender deer</p>
              <p class="v2">in the forest.</p>
            </div><!--end verse-->
      </div><!--end:sutta-->
    </div><!--end:content-->
    
